// The engine's own strings in English: castle64's captions (issue #60).
// `caption = "cap.coin"` on a sound in assets/manifest.toml names a key
// here; `cargo xtask access check` fails a key a language lacks.
Strings(
    lang: "en-US",
    entries: {
        "cap.coin": "[coin chimes]",
        "cap.star": "[fanfare: star collected]",
        "cap.hurt": "[ouch]",
    },
)
